step 15 "Delver"
out d "\n\r\n\rTHIS IS A MUD BASED ON.....\n\r\n\r                                ROM Version 2.4 beta\n\r\n\r               Original DikuMUD by Hans Staerfeldt, Katja Nyboe,\n\r               Tom Madsen, Michael Seifert, and Sebastian Hammer\n\r               Based on MERC 2.1 code by Hatchet, Furey, and Kahn\n\r               ROM 2.4 copyright (c) 1993-1998 Russ Taylor\n\r\n\rBy what name do you wish to be known? Password: \xff\xfb\x01"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 16 "psswrd"
out d "\n\r\xff\xfc\x01* You are responsible for knowing the rules (type 'rules').  Ignorance of \n\r  the rules is no excuse.\n\r* Important commands: help, commands, news, notes\n\r* Use the delete command to erase unwanted characters\n\r  \n\r[Hit Return to continue]\n\r"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 17 "@return"
out d "\n\rWelcome to Charm.  Please don't feed the mobiles!\n\rOn the Concourse\n\r  The concourse continues its path around the city.  The southern gates of the\n\rcity are west of here, and park road lies north.  The northeastern corner of\n\rthe city wall is east.\n\r\nNum          Name Unread Description\n\r==== ============ ====== =============================\n\r( 1)      General [   0] General discussion\n\r( 2)        Ideas [   0] Suggestion for improvement\n\r( 3)     Announce [   0] Announcements from Immortals\n\r( 4)         Bugs [   0] Typos, bugs, errors\n\r( 5)     Personal [   0] Personal messages\n\r\n\rYou current board is General.\n\rYou can both read and write on this board.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 18 "scroll 0"
out d "Paging disabled.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 19 "commands"
out d "cast        auction     buy         channels    exits       get         \n\rgroup       inventory   kill        look        clan        music       \n\rorder       practice    rest        scan        sit         stand       \n\rtell        unlock      wield       affects     areas       board       \n\rcommands    compare     consider    count       credits     equipment   \n\rexamine     help        info        motd        read        report      \n\rrules       score       skills      socials     show        spells      \n\rstory       time        typo        weather     who         whois       \n\rwizlist     worth       alias       autolist    autoall     autoassist  \n\rautoexit    autogold    autoloot    autosac     autosplit   brief       \n\rcolour      color       combine     compact     description delete      \n\rnofollow    noloot      nosummon    outfit      password    prompt      \n\rscroll      telnetga    title       unalias     wimpy       afk         \n\ranswer      deaf        emote       pmote       gossip      grats       \n\rgtell       note        pose        question    quote       quiet       \n\rreply       replay      say         yell        brandish    close       \n\rdrink       drop        eat         envenom     fill        give        \n\rheal        hold        list        lock        open        pick        \n\rpour        put         quaff       recite      remove      sell        \n\rtake        sacrifice   value       wear        zap         backstab    \n\rbash        berserk     dirt        disarm      flee        kick        \n\rsurrender   trip        enter       follow      gain        groups      \n\rhide        play        quit        recall      save        sleep       \n\rsneak       split       steal       train       visible     wake        \n\rwhere       edit        asave       alist       resets      redit       \n\rmedit       aedit       oedit       mpedit      hedit       \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
